{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Midnight Wind is a sarcastic single-player pixel art RPG following the story of four hosts of the souls of a dead star. The story loosely takes place in Indonesia, where players will embark on a bare-bones journey to protect themselves and their people. The four hosts are named Altara, Osmos, Nabur, and Torren Voldusaya, the bratty children of a royal family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 different enemies to encounter </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 260 different weapons and armors to equip </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 12 characters to play as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Approximately 20 hours of gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 200+ different items to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- &quot;Interesting&quot; dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current version 1.5 Beta. We're back!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1659610?t=1743362378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743362378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743362378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659610/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743362378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This product contains mature language, themes, depiction\r\nof drugs, violence, and sexual language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Midnight Wind is a sarcastic single-player pixel art RPG following the story of four hosts of the souls of a dead star. The story loosely takes place in Indonesia, where players will embark on a bare-bones journey to protect themselves and their people. The four hosts are named Altara, Osmos, Nabur, and Torren Voldusaya, the bratty children of a royal family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently includes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 different enemies to encounter </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 260 different weapons and armors to equip </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 12 characters to play as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Approximately 20 hours of gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 200+ different items to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- &quot;Interesting&quot; dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Current version 1.5 Beta. We're back!</p>","developers":["Jeremiah Valles","Jay Valles"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659610/header.jpg?t=1743362378","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256841587,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256841587/movie480.mp4?t=1639682000","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256841587/movie_max.mp4?t=1639682000"},"name":"The Midnight Wind Trailer Mark II","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256841587/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1639682000","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256841587/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1639682000","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256841587/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1639682000"}}],"name":"The Midnight Wind","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default"